<title>JAPAN: Dai Nippon Constr - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Dai Nippon Constr - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		125.10		vs	  123.50</p>
<p> Operating	    2.55		vs	    3.48</p>
<p> Current		1.04		vs	    1.52</p>
<p> Net		  360 million	 vs	  583 million</p>
<p> EPS		    6.36 yen	  vs	   10.29 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     57 million	  vs	  57 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Dai Nippon Construction is a civil engineering contractor affiliated with Kinki Nippon Railway Co Ltd.</p>
